      "writtenOn": "2024-06-10T14:33:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we can isolate it just to the x-axis since we don\u0027t actually apply any rotation for the start angle in the local matrix transform but we apply it as our bias below so I believe the vertical axis may still be affected because of this.",
      "parentUuid": "058a0278_5cbcfc1e",
      "range": {
